<title>UK: LME copper drifts off highs, lead vulnerable.</title>
<headline>LME copper drifts off highs, lead vulnerable.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Off highs, settles above $2,360. Cash/threes narrower around $65 backwardation.</p>
<p>LEAD - Vulnerable, slumps near recent low of $624.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Holds slightly firmer levels above $1,630.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Under $7,400. TIN - Easier</p>
<p>ZINC - Drifts off highs to unchanged level.</p>
</text>
